  - message: You have to find four pieces of paper with numbers on them
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 2
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: ' You have to stare at them until the numbers disappear, in ascending
      order'
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 3
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: Ahmm...
    isPlayer: 1
    replies:
    - replyText: I curse every one of you who created this!
      nextNode: 4
    - replyText: ' I don''t want to play anymore. I can''t take it anymore. I can''t
        bear this anymore.'
      nextNode: 5
    nextNode: 0
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: Whatever you choose, in the end, it's your own choice.
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: Stay calm
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 6
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: You just need to find the pieces of paper with numbers on them
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 7
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: and look at them in ascending order, all four of them.
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: But be careful, try to keep your eyes open. Do not close your eyes under
      any circumstances
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
  - message: And if anything is watching you, do not move. 9:00 PM - 9:40 PM. This
      night is so long
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 10
    recordsRule: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5598f4d3ffb180f459b80781d12a3fa0, type: 2}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
